Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 1200
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Output site/demos/gifs/onboard-verified.gif

Hide
Type "exec bash --noprofile --norc"
Enter
Type "export PS1='user@bray:bray $ '; alias claude=./site/demos/bray-demo.sh; clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s
Show

Type "claude -p 'Use onboard-verified to show the verified identity setup workflow'"
Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /(?m)^user@bray:bray \$\s*$/
Sleep 3s
